title: 'pallet-xcm: improve `weigh_message` benchmark'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Improves the `weigh_message` benchmark. Adds `pallet_xcm::benchmarking::Config::wrap_call`,
    which you can override if you have a pallet that dispatches a single inner call.
crates:
- name: pallet-xcm
  bump: minor
